        "original_id": "87c671dc-e06a-559c-a5e5-e9638dcc8120",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Spanky, DJ Pierre, Herb J, Joey Beltram, Paul Woolford, Vladislav Delay, ASC, xxxy, Appleblim, Al Tourettes\n- Organizations: Phuture, Halocyan Records\n- Places: Chicago, Los Angeles, United Kingdom, continental Europe\n- Concepts: acid house, rave scenes, electronic musicians, DJs\n\nFacts:\n- Phuture was founded in 1985 in Chicago, United States, by Spanky, DJ Pierre, and Herb J.\n- Phuture is an American Chicago-based acid-house group of electronic musicians.\n- Acid house spread to the United Kingdom and continental Europe, where DJs played it in the acid house scene and later in rave scenes.\n- Halocyan Records is based in Los Angeles, California.\n- Halocyan Records has released music by DJ Pierre of Phuture, Paul Woolford, techno pioneer Joey Beltram, Vladislav Delay as Sistol, ASC, xxxy, and Appleblim and Al Tourettes.",
